    "backstory": "Once a high-roller in Subchain City, \"Slick\" learned the hard way that even pearls can't buy you a clean escape from the Rotted Toxic Swamps. Now, exiled from the upper echelons, he navigates the treacherous Smuggler's Alley, forever haunted by the toxic touch that turned his body into a biohazard symbol.",
